    {
      "title": "Check which k values give a finite sum",
      "body": "<p>Treat <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math> as fixed and identify the first term and ratio as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math> increases. Check the ratio condition before using the infinite sum formula.</p>",
      "recap": "An infinite geometric sum needs a common ratio whose size is less than 1.",
